id: SCA-072
title: Typosquatting indicator in dependency name
category: supply-chain
severity: error
engine: pattern
target:
  filenames: package.json requirements.txt Gemfile Cargo.toml go.mod
  exclude_paths: test/ node_modules/ .git/ vendor/
patterns:
  - regex: (requets|reqests|requsets|requists|lodsah|loadsh|collors|colros)
    message: Possible typosquatting — package name matches known misspelling of popular package. Attackers publish packages with similar names to steal credentials.
  - regex: (ejs-templat|espress|expresss|axois)
    message: Possible typosquatting — dependency name is a common misspelling of a popular package.
fix: Double-check package names against the official registry. Use lockfiles with integrity hashes. Consider tools like Socket.dev for typosquatting detection.
